            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41) is usually the best option after the other powers got nerfed to the ground.\n\n## Items\n\nWe take [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) in most games, and [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) because I don't like attack speed on Cass, and the other items feel useless. [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) is alright as well instead of [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) but on some maps it's really good to be faster than the enemies.",
