            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is a must-pick. Then, spam green HP items.\n\nIf there's enough cash, we can get [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) or the newly buffed [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1), as it's the highest potential damage option. Another green HP item doesn't hurt either, like [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7).",
