            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) pairs well with [Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41). Pay attention to your cooldown, don\u2019t forget that it decreases by 2s after you land a headshot.\n\n## Items\n\n[Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) and [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) are 15% WP just like [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), but they also give 25 more HP and offer a useful effect, mainly the overhealth. This means you can take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) along with a green HP item if you're up against armored heroes. Those are mostly tank heroes, if you don't wanna focus the tank, then don't take it.\n\nIf you have a really good round, you can go for [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), but I wouldn't recommend it if it means losing most of your HP items.\n\nAgainst flying heroes such as Pharah, Freja, Mercy, Juno, or even D.Va, Winston, and Genji, you can take the new [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) instead of [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1). It's less about the 10 bonus damage and more about the slow effect.\n\nVery similar to that, [Wanted Poster](item_303665c3-5c81-4138-9bcc-efd2c52a63dd) but it has no attack.\n\n[Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) is great in Cass duels or against heroes who like to headshot a lot like Zen or Soldier.",
