            "notes": "Get the [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce). Usually, I take [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) because it's more consistent and works with right-click. Cass, Ashe, D.Va, Orisa, and Zenyatta are on the easier side to headshot\u2014for example, against those, [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) might be slightly better.\n\nIn most rounds, sell I sell one of the rare Items like [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) or [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1). If it's a poor round simply get [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nUpgrade [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) if you have enough money.\n\n## COUNTERPICK ITEMS - I WONT GO OVER THEM AGAIN IN FUTURE ROUNDS\n\nTake [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) against heroes who can easily headshot you like Cass, Ashe (WP), DVA(WP), Genji (he has an item that lets him crit with melee), Ana (with crit power), Soldier, Kiriko, or Zenyatta.\n\nYou can counter-pick Ashe (AP), Ana, Junker Queen, Mei, or general debuff-heavy comps with [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f).\n\n[Wanted Poster](item_303665c3-5c81-4138-9bcc-efd2c52a63dd) and [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) are still solid choices against flying and airborne heroes.",
