            "notes": "## Power  \n\n[Barrel Roll](item_c5368723-a7c9-4124-9bc1-7749917b0c8a) offers slightly more survivability. It helps you kite more effectively when you're under pressure.  \n\n## Items  \n\nR5 is when we need to start picking up some tanky items, like [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f). If not [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f), then [Divine Intervention] or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)(item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) are a solid choice. [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) has a pretty generous window, this item is really strong.\n\nFor more offensive buys when you aren\u2019t pressured much, you can get [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) by replacing one of the green HP items. You can also outright buy another damage item like [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), or [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100).  \n\nFor damage, we keep our rare items. If you have enough cash, consider upgrading [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) or another desirable counterpick item from earlier.  \n\nIf you STILL have enough cash, you can grab [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) or another counterpick item mentioned previously.",
