            "created_at": "2025-09-20T04:44:30.675138+00:00",
            "notes": "## Items\n\nMore damage with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce). Use [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) for poor rounds. [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is also a solid pick if you need to be tankier.\n\nIf you have enough money, upgrade [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) and/or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1), [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182), or any of the earlier counterpick items.\n\n[El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) should be considered if there's a lot of healing. You can replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) with it.\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) can also be upgraded with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if there's a lot of armor.",
