            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-20T04:44:30.675138+00:00",
            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Full House](item_0001a9dc-79d5-48c9-92b0-85060efd897e) for slightly more damage, or [Dead Man Walking](item_9cde0648-950a-4c83-bc49-382a2c33df79) for slightly more ammo or [Think Flasht](item_3bce3ff6-cbf3-4515-b5cb-648f536a1d37) for a longer stun. They are all about the same; you could go with no power and it would barely make a difference because they are all so bad.\n\n## Items\n\n[Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) generally becomes better late game than [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), in my opinion, because you get your ult faster. If you really need to be tanky, you can get both [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) together. [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is also still great against burst damage.\n\nIn most games, the new damage item to pick is [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) because there is so much healing in the current meta with heroes like Mercy and Moira in every game. There are some alternatives listed below as well. Otherwise, [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is the highest and cheapest WP item you can get.\n\nIf you have even more money to replace the last green or blue item, then mix and match with any of the optional ones that you feel are good for the current game. A cheap upgrade is replacing [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1). More expensive upgrades include [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) and [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or just another defensive item.",
